<title>SPAIN: Spain's Atlantica H1 profit up 63.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Atlantica H1 profit up 63.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half results for Spanish bank Banco Atlantico</p>
<p>				    (billion pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Net attributable profit		3.53    vs   2.16</p>
<p> Net profit				 3.54    vs   2.16</p>
<p> Pretax profit			    5.58    vs   3.87</p>
<p> Net interest income		   13.40    vs  14.46</p>
<p> Ordinary income			 20.44    vs  19.97</p>
<p> Operating income			 4.99    vs   4.76</p>
</text>
